# Playwright MCP

This repo has a project Playwright MCP server in `.cursor/mcp.json`.

When checking live UI (Pages or local), desktop vs mobile layout, or visual regressions after UI changes:

1. Prefer the **playwright** MCP tools over guessing from HTML alone.
2. Default live URL: `https://lucas-albers-lz4.github.io/happycow/`
3. Compare at least one desktop viewport (~1440×900) and one phone viewport (~390×844) for layout issues.
4. Screenshots land under `.cursor/browser-output/` (gitignored).
